Third-Party Components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project does not bundle or vendor third-party source code or assets; the
only included images are this project's own architecture diagrams. It relies on
third-party open-source dependencies that are referenced (not redistributed
here), each retaining its own license:

  - Python dependencies are declared in pyproject.toml and pinned in uv.lock.
  - JavaScript/frontend dependencies are declared in frontend/package.json and
    pinned in frontend/package-lock.json.

Consult those manifests and each package's own distribution for its license
text.

When the optional web search feature is enabled, this project queries
DuckDuckGo, a third-party service. See the "Third-Party Services" section of
README.md for details and a link to DuckDuckGo's terms of service.
